			<div class="content" id="post-content-4106184">
									

<p>My first submission to the wiki. Please let me know what you think. Unless you vehemently hate it, in which case, shush!</p>
<p>Kendal mint cake isn’t proper cake, like a nice, light coffee and walnut sponge, or a strawberry gateaux; it’s just this weird, crumbly slab of sugar and glucose flavoured with peppermint, and sometimes covered in chocolate to hide it. I don’t like it very much, but I imagine it’s the kind of thing that a knock-off Shoggoth might be into..? Right?</p>
<p>Don’t even get me started on Azathoth and Curlywhirly bars.</p>
<p>Huge thanks to my wonderful reviewers: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kakroom" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2198340); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2198340&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="Kakroom" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2198340)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kakroom" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2198340); return false;">Kakroom</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reverend-fox" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1893953); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1893953&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="Reverend Fox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1893953)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reverend-fox" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1893953); return false;">Reverend Fox</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;">RockTeethMothEyes</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mayoculpa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489662); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3489662&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="mayoculpa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3489662