<p>Also, thanks to everyone who reviewed my earlier attempts which I decided to shelf for the time being; They gave me a lot of great advice which (hopefully) prevented me making the same mistakes again in this article. Including (but not limited to) <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1372582); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1372582&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="Jacob Conwell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1372582)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1372582); return false;">Jacob Conwell</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1173523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547910431" alt="Eskobar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1173523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;">Eskobar</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikido